{
 "id": "seg3",
 "title": "四种验证方式",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 133.3,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "验证的方式，大致有四种。差别在于，你信任谁。",
   "spoken": "验证的方式，大致有四种。差别在于，你信任谁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 5.592,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 6.35
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "第一种，外部多签，或者 MPC。",
   "spoken": "第一种，外部多签，或者 MPC。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-01.mp3",
   "start": 7.412,
   "dur": 3.312,
   "speechStart": 7.51,
   "speechEnd": 9.891
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "一组验证者，凑够门限个签名，就放行。",
   "spoken": "一组验证者，凑够门限个签名，就放行。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.944,
   "dur": 4.272,
   "speechStart": 11.042,
   "speechEnd": 14.387
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "你信任的是这些签名人。风险是私钥泄露，验证者共谋，或者门限太低。",
   "spoken": "你信任的是这些签名人。风险是私钥泄漏，验证者共谋，或者门限太低。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-03.mp3",
   "start": 15.436,
   "dur": 6.912,
   "speechStart": 15.534,
   "speechEnd": 21.519
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "Ronin 就是这一种。",
   "spoken": "Ronin 就是这一种。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-04.mp3",
   "start": 22.568,
   "dur": 2.328,
   "speechStart": 22.666,
   "speechEnd": 24.07
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "第二种，轻客户端，也叫原生证明。",
   "spoken": "第二种，轻客户端，也叫原生证明。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-05.mp3",
   "start": 25.116,
   "dur": 4.056,
   "speechStart": 25.214,
   "speechEnd": 28.333
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "B 链上的合约，自己验证 A 链的区块头和证明。",
   "spoken": "B 链上的合约，自己验证 A 链的区块头和证明。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-06.mp3",
   "start": 29.392,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 29.49,
   "speechEnd": 32.859
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "你信任的是 A 链的共识，加上这段证明验证代码。",
   "spoken": "你信任的是 A 链的共识，加上这段证明验证代码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-07.mp3",
   "start": 33.932,
   "dur": 4.992,
   "speechStart": 34.03,
   "speechEnd": 38.077
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "代码有漏洞，证明就能伪造。2022 年的 BNB Chain Token Hub，属于这一种。",
   "spoken": "代码有漏洞，证明就能伪造。2022 年的 BNB Chain Token Hub，属于这一种。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-08.mp3",
   "start": 39.144,
   "dur": 6.984,
   "speechStart": 39.242,
   "speechEnd": 45.311
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "第三种，乐观证明。",
   "spoken": "第三种，乐观证明。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-09.mp3",
   "start": 46.348,
   "dur": 2.808,
   "speechStart": 46.446,
   "speechEnd": 48.327
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "消息默认有效，但留出一段挑战期。这期间，任何人都可以提交欺诈证明推翻它。",
   "spoken": "消息默认有效，但留出一段挑战期。这期间，任何人都可以提交欺诈证明推翻它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-10.mp3",
   "start": 49.376,
   "dur": 7.8,
   "speechStart": 49.474,
   "speechEnd": 56.352
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "你只需要一个诚实的挑战者。风险是挑战期里没人盯着，或者挑战者被审查。",
   "spoken": "你只需要一个诚实的挑战者。风险是挑战期里没人盯着，或者挑战者被审查。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-11.mp3",
   "start": 57.396,
   "dur": 7.584,
   "speechStart": 57.494,
   "speechEnd": 64.134
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "多数乐观 Rollup 的原生桥，用的是这一种。",
   "spoken": "多数乐观 Rollup 的原生桥，用的是这一种。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-12.mp3",
   "start": 65.2,
   "dur": 4.056,
   "speechStart": 65.298,
   "speechEnd": 68.429
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "第四种，零知识证明。",
   "spoken": "第四种，零知识证明。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-13.mp3",
   "start": 69.476,
   "dur": 2.832,
   "speechStart": 69.574,
   "speechEnd": 71.455
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "用数学证明 A 链的状态变化是正确的，不用逐条核对账本。",
   "spoken": "用数学证明 A 链的状态变化是正确的，不用逐条核对账本。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-14.mp3",
   "start": 72.528,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 72.626,
   "speechEnd": 77.197
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "你信任的是数学，加上证明系统的实现和可信设置。电路或验证器写错，一样会出事。",
   "spoken": "你信任的是数学，加上证明系统的实现和可信设置。电路或验证器写错，一样会出事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-15.mp3",
   "start": 78.268,
   "dur": 8.016,
   "speechStart": 78.366,
   "speechEnd": 85.435
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "再猜一道题。一座 ZK 桥，证明系统完全正确，但桥合约可以被一个多签无延迟升级。",
   "spoken": "再猜一道题。一座 ZK 桥，证明系统完全正确，但桥合约可以被一个多签无延迟升级。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-16.mp3",
   "start": 86.504,
   "dur": 8.232,
   "speechStart": 86.602,
   "speechEnd": 93.897
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "用户只需要信任数学吗？",
   "spoken": "用户只需要信任数学吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-17.mp3",
   "start": 94.956,
   "dur": 2.76,
   "speechStart": 95.054,
   "speechEnd": 96.887
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "不是。多签可以把桥合约换成新实现，绕过证明系统。",
   "spoken": "不是。多签可以把桥合约换成新实现，绕过证明系统。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-18.mp3",
   "start": 98.216,
   "dur": 5.712,
   "speechStart": 98.314,
   "speechEnd": 103.085
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "用户同时信任证明系统，和升级权限的持有人。",
   "spoken": "用户同时信任证明系统，和升级权限的持有人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-19.mp3",
   "start": 104.148,
   "dur": 4.656,
   "speechStart": 104.246,
   "speechEnd": 107.984
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "按 L2BEAT 截至 2026 年的页面，Mantle 用的是 OP Succinct 有效性证明。",
   "spoken": "按 L2BEAT 截至 2026 年的页面，Mantle 用的是 OP Succinct 有效性证明。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-20.mp3",
   "start": 109.024,
   "dur": 6.816,
   "speechStart": 109.122,
   "speechEnd": 115.003
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-21",
   "text": "但它的输出预言机，可以由工程多签切换到乐观模式。桥合约可以由安全多签无延迟升级。",
   "spoken": "但它的输出预言机，可以由工程多签切换到乐观模式。桥合约可以由安全多签无延迟升级。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-21.mp3",
   "start": 116.06,
   "dur": 8.256,
   "speechStart": 116.158,
   "speechEnd": 123.465
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-22",
   "text": "L2 的原生桥，也是一座跨链桥。它的安全，取决于证明系统和升级权限两样。",
   "spoken": "L2 的原生桥，也是一座跨链桥。它的安全，取决于证明系统和升级权限两样。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-22.mp3",
   "start": 124.536,
   "dur": 7.56,
   "speechStart": 124.634,
   "speechEnd": 131.262
  }
